                                                "sense_id": "b7b620cc-44f1-3cf5-92f0-7a8640c1e17d",
                                                "text": "Treatment of an acute occult dislocation of the ankle consists of immobilization in a snugly fitting plaster-of-paris cast, with little padding."
                                            },
